  // Every teleport starts well above its stand point and the long waits do double duty: the
  // player lands, and the streaming ring fills around the new position before the frame is taken.
  // Pitches stay shallow where they can: a steep downward look brings the first-person hand in.
  // The aerial forest shots teleport up and screenshot with no wait: a teleport + screenshot pair
  // ticks no physics, so the pose is held exactly.
